#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/xdotool.xml:26
#, xml-text
msgid "Introduction to xdotool"
msgstr "Introdução a xdotool"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/xdotool.xml:29
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <application>xdotool</application> package provides the capabilities to "
"simulate keyboard input and mouse activity, move and resize windows, etc. It"
" does this using X11’s XTEST extension and other Xlib functions."
msgstr ""
"O pacote <application>xdotool</application> fornece os recursos para simular"
" entrada de teclado e atividade de mouse, mover e redimensionar janelas, "
"etc. Ele faz isso usando a extensão XTEST do X11 e outras funções da Xlib."

